<title>UK: IBCA rates L-bank 200 mln stg 2001 notes at AAA.</title>
<headline>IBCA rates L-bank 200 mln stg 2001 notes at AAA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>IBCA, the European credit rating agency, said on Tuesday it had assigned an AAA rating to the 200 million sterling 7.375 percent 2001 note issue of Landeskreditbank Baden-Wuerttenberg.</p>
<p>&quot;The rating is based on the implied federal German guarantee for the obligations of L-bank,&quot; IBCA said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Kate Kelland, International Bonds Unit +44 171 542 8682</p>
</text>
